Bug 2060072 - Fix gloda constraint failed errors from leaked conversationsText rows.

Delete the conversationsText row in deleteConversationByID() to stop leaking
fulltext rows when conversations are deleted. The leaked rows could cause a
duplicate-docid "constraint failed" (SQLITE_CONSTRAINT, error 19) in
INSERT INTO conversationsText when _nextConversationId was re-allocated.

Seed _nextConversationId from MAX(docid) of conversationsText in addition
to MAX(id) of conversations in _populateConversationManagedId(), so ids
already leaked by past versions can never be re-allocated. This heals
existing profiles without deleting data.

Log the SQL of failing statements in a SQLTrackingStatementWrapper so
errors can be attributed to the statement that caused them.

